#: templates/commands.html:654 templates/commands.html:662
msgid "A | B inside <...> means choose one of the alternatives"
msgstr "A | B i <...> betyder att du väljer ett av alternativen"

#: templates/commands.html:655 templates/commands.html:669
#: templates/commands.html:676
msgid "... means \"repeat as needed\""
